The '''Anaxes canyon'''<ref name="Concept Art Gallery">{{SW|url=tv-shows/the-clone-wars-legacy/bad-batch-concept-art-gallery|text=Bad Batch Concept Art Gallery}} {{C|Slide 7}}</ref> was a [[canyon]] located on the [[planet]] [[Anaxes]]. During the [[Battle of Anaxes]], a [[Low Altitude Assault Transport/infantry|Republic gunship]] was shot down by [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] [[DSD1 dwarf spider droid]]s and crashed in the canyon. [[Clone Commander]] [[Cody|CC-2224]] was injured in the crash, but [[Clone Force 99]] combated the Separatist forces using [[Plan 82]] and allowed the Republic forces to continue with their mission to infiltrate the [[Cyber Center]].<ref name="TBB" />

